Third-party assets bundled with hermes-dashboard
================================================

assets/favicon.ico
------------------
The default browser-tab icon is the Hermes Agent mark, taken unmodified from
the upstream project (hermes_cli/web_dist/favicon.ico) so that a dashboard of a
Hermes installation carries the same icon as the agent's own web UI.

